{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55226","headline":"寒食（题拟） · 裴说","name":"寒食（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云浓云淡半阴春，禁火天时欲洒尘。\n花艳有枝还怕雨，柳烟无赖尚重人。\n画球轻蹴壶中地，彩索高飞掌上身。\n一路绿莎东郭外，也宽情抱也伤神。\n（见《古今合璧事类备要前集》卷十六。\n）（按：《唐音戊签》九八据《事文类聚》收五六两句，《全唐诗》卷七二○已收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55226.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55226","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}